GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 83.31(2) the report includes the item` MEANS
    CONSIDER item
    WHEN `s 83.31(2) another item` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): "an annual report for the previous year on the operation of section 83.3 that includes"
    OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

